content.text:
5. CSS missing: `.shake`, zone styles, `.orb-toss`, SVG `.mgfx`, maybe `.battle-mon` art size. Also title screen hidden? Good.

Add CSS:
```
.battle-scene.shake { animation: sceneShake .3s; }
@keyframes sceneShake ...
.zone-forest .battle-scene { background... } override gradient maybe.
.orb-toss { position:absolute; left:12%; bottom:32%; font-size... animation: tossOrb .9s forwards; color gold; z-index:7; }
@keyframes tossOrb...
.mgfx { animation: mgfxFloat 4s ease-in-out infinite; transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin:center; }
@keyframes mgfxFloat...
```
Also `#evo-silhouette` flash etc.
`#battle-actions` bag-grid might need height; fine.
`#dialogue` pointer events.

